OL,5,G0300 Julia Bradbury's Wonders of the
OL,6,G     Frozen South
OL,7,     FJulia sails to the rugged island
OL,8,     Fof South Georgia, which rises from
OL,9,     Fthe South Atlantic and has an
OL,10,     Fextraordinary abundance of
OL,11,     Fwildlife and a haunting human
OL,12,     Fhistory. Landing on Salisbury
OL,13,     FPlain, Julia navigates to reach a
OL,14,     Fvast colony of more than 100,000
OL,15,     Fking penguins that crowd the
OL,16,     Fbeach, as well as the whaling
OL,17,     Fstation that became polar explorer
OL,18,     FErnest Shackleton's salvation, and
OL,19,     Fsees some of the largest seals in
OL,20,     Fthe world
